# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Brother P-touch (180 dpi, 128-dot head), TZe tapes
#
# PrintableDots is how many head dots the tape can take, centred on the head;
# it is less than the tape width. Values from Brother's raster command
# reference as used by ptouch-print. StatusMm is the width the printer
# reports for the loaded tape (3.5 mm tape reports 4).

Id: tze-3.5
Family: brother-pt
Name: TZe 3.5 mm tape
Kind: continuous
WidthMm: 3.5
PrintableDots: 24
StatusMm: 4
Source: ptouch-print tape_info (Brother raster reference)

Id: tze-6
Family: brother-pt
Name: TZe 6 mm tape
